# Review instructions for homelab-gitops/infrastructure/cloudflare/.
# This is a patch sketch, not an independently applicable Terraform root.
# Keep the existing Tutor Matcher hostname and localhost:3333 route unchanged.
# Candidate hostname/port require an authorized conflict and access check.

# 1. Add "tutor-matcher-microservice.${var.zone_name}" to
#    locals.tunnel_hostnames in dns.tf.

# 2. Insert this object into the EXISTING tunnel.tf config.ingress list,
#    before its final http_status:404 catch-all:
# {
#   hostname = "tutor-matcher-microservice.${var.zone_name}"
#   service  = "http://localhost:3334"
# }

# 3. Review the intended course audience before changing access.tf.
#    Do not inherit a personal-only Access allowlist without checking that the
#    instructor and demo users can reach the application. Tutor Matcher still
#    enforces its own sessions, capabilities and resource ownership.
#    Tunnel routing alone is not an Access policy.

# 4. Keep origin port 3334 unavailable from LAN/Internet; host-mode Swarm
#    publication is not loopback-only. Validate the host's actual Docker-aware
#    IPv4/IPv6 firewall boundary before enabling this route.
# No Cloudflare account/tunnel identifiers, tokens or state are copied here.
